<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0A192F">
<title>PathKeeper | Strategic Intelligence & Opportunity Atlas</title>

<style>
:root {
  --navy: #0A192F;
  --navy-light: #152B46;
  --brown: #8B4513;
  --brown-light: #C87D55;
  --gold: #C5A059;
  --cream: #FDFBF7;
  --cream-dark: #F0E7DC;
  --white: #FFFFFF;
  --text: #24354A;
  --muted: #647084;
  --border: #E3D6C8;
  --success: #276749;
  --radius: 16px;
  --shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(10,25,47,.07);
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; scroll-padding-top: 95px; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: Inter, system-ui, Arial, sans-serif;
  line-height: 1.65;
}

button, input, select, textarea { font: inherit; }
button { cursor: pointer; }
a { color: inherit; }
button:focus-visible, a:focus-visible, input:focus-visible,
select:focus-visible, textarea:focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid var(--gold);
  outline-offset: 3px;
}

.site-header {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 50;
  background: rgba(253,251,247,.97);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
}

.nav-wrap {
  max-width: 1280px;
  margin: auto;
  padding: 12px 22px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 18px;
}

.brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
.brand-mark {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  width: 44px;
  height: 44px;
  background: var(--navy);
  color: var(--gold);
  border: 1px solid var(--brown-light);
  border-radius: 12px;
  font-size: 24px;
}
.brand-name { color: var(--navy); font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 850; }
.brand-sub { color: var(--brown); font-size: .7rem; display: block; }
.nav-links { display: flex; gap: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.nav-links a {
  font-size: .8rem;
  font-weight: 750;
  text-decoration: none;
}
.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--brown); }

.button {
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 11px 16px;
  font-weight: 750;
  font-size: .85rem;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 7px;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: .2s;
}
.button:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
.button-primary { background: var(--navy); color: white; }
.button-primary:hover { background: var(--navy-light); }
.button-brown { background: var(--brown); color: white; }
.button-brown:hover { background: #703816; }
.button-outline { background: transparent; color: var(--navy); border-color: var(--border); }
.button-outline:hover { background: var(--cream-dark); }
.button-small { padding: 8px 11px; font-size: .78rem; }

.hero {
  padding: 68px 22px 55px;
  background: linear-gradient(145deg, #F5EDE3, var(--cream) 62%);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.hero-inner { max-width: 1050px; margin: auto; text-align: center; }
.eyebrow {
  display: inline-block;
  background: #F4ECE6;
  color: var(--brown);
  border: 1px solid #D7B69D;
  border-radius: 99px;
  padding: 6px 13px;
  font-size: .7rem;
  font-weight: 850;
  letter-spacing: 1.2px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
h1, h2, h3, h4 { line-height: 1.25; }
.hero h1 {
  color: var(--navy);
  font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  letter-spacing: -1.7px;
  margin: 20px 0 15px;
}
.hero p { max-width: 800px; margin: auto; color: var(--muted); }
.hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 24px; }

.search-panel {
  max-width: 850px;
  margin: 28px auto 0;
  padding: 15px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 15px;
  background: white;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  text-align: left;
}
.search-row { display: flex; gap: 9px; }
.search-row input { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
input, select, textarea {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 11px 12px;
  border: 1px solid #D7DDE5;
  background: white;
  color: var(--navy);
  border-radius: 9px;
}
label { display: block; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.quick-filters { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 12px; align-items: center; }
.quick-filters button {
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--navy);
  border-radius: 99px;
  padding: 5px 10px;
  font-size: .72rem;
  font-weight: 750;
}
.quick-filters button:hover { background: var(--cream-dark); }

main { max-width: 1280px; margin: auto; padding: 45px 22px 70px; }
.section { margin-bottom: 65px; }
.section-heading { margin-bottom: 23px; border-left: 4px solid var(--brown); padding-left: 16px; }
.section-kicker { color: var(--brown); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 900; }
.section-heading h2 { color: var(--navy); font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 3vw, 2.3rem); margin: 5px 0 8px; }
.section-heading p { color: var(--muted); font-size: .92rem; margin: 0; max-width: 850px; }

.grid { display: grid; gap: 18px; }
.grid-2 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr)); }
.grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0,1fr)); }
.grid-4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0,1fr)); }

.card {
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 22px;
  box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(10,25,47,.025);
  min-width: 0;
  transition: border-color .2s, transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;
}
.card:hover { border-color: #CBA98D; box-shadow: var(--shadow); transform: translateY(-2px); }
.card h3, .card h4 { color: var(--navy); margin: 5px 0 10px; }
.card p { color: var(--muted); font-size: .87rem; margin: 0 0 12px; }
.card p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.card-tag {
  display: inline-block;
  color: var(--brown);
  background: #F7EEE6;
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 4px 8px;
  font-size: .66rem;
  font-weight: 900;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: .6px;
}
.card-icon {
  width: 42px; height: 42px; display: grid; place-items: center;
  border-radius: 11px; background: var(--cream-dark); color: var(--brown);
  font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 13px;
}
.card-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 16px; }
.card details { border-top: 1px solid #EEE6DD; margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 12px; }
.card summary { cursor: pointer; color: var(--brown); font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 850; }
.card details p { margin-top: 12px; }

.number {
  display: inline-grid;
  place-items: center;
  width: 39px; height: 39px;
  background: var(--cream-dark);
  color: var(--brown);
  border-radius: 10px;
  font-weight: 900;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.dark-panel {
  background: var(--navy);
  color: var(--cream);
  border-radius: 22px;
  padding: 28px;
  border: 1px solid #203854;
}
.dark-panel h2, .dark-panel h3, .dark-panel h4 { color: white; }
.dark-panel p { color: #D0D8E3; }
.dark-panel .section-kicker { color: var(--gold); }
.dark-panel .card { background: #12253D; border-color: #2A3F57; }
.dark-panel .card h3, .dark-panel .card h4 { color: white; }
.dark-panel .card p { color: #D0D8E3; }

.callout {
  padding: 19px 22px;
  background: #F7F0E8;
  border: 1px solid #E3C8AF;
  border-radius: 14px;
  color: var(--navy);
  margin: 20px 0;
}
.callout strong { color: var(--brown); }

.tab-bar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin: 18px 0; }
.tab-button {
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: white;
  color: var(--navy);
  border-radius: 9px;
  padding: 10px 13px;
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: .8rem;
}
.tab-button.active { background: var(--brown); color: white; border-color: var(--brown); }
.tab-panel { padding: 22px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: white; border-radius: 15px; }
.tab-panel h3 { color: var(--navy); }

.filters {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
  gap: 12px;
  padding: 16px;
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 13px;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}
.filter-buttons { display: flex; gap: 7px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
.filter-button {
  padding: 7px 11px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--navy);
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-size: .74rem;
  font-weight: 800;
}
.filter-button.active { background: var(--navy); color: white; border-color: var(--navy); }
.meta { font-size: .75rem; color: var(--brown); font-weight: 800; }
.result-count { font-size: .8rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 10px 0; }

.skill-options { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr); gap: 10px; margin: 16px 0; }
.skill-option {
  display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; padding: 12px;
  background: #12253D; border: 1px solid #2A3F57; border-radius: 10px;
  font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 700;
}
.skill-option input { width: auto; accent-color: var(--gold); }
.module-status { color: var(--gold); font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 900; }
.module.locked { opacity: .52; }
.module.unlocked { border-color: var(--gold); }
.module.unlocked .module-status { color: #A8E0BB; }

.model-steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6,1fr); gap: 10px; }
.model-step {
  background: white; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 17px 10px; text-align: center;
}
.model-step span { display: block; font-size: .7rem; color: var(--brown); font-weight: 900; }
.model-step strong { color: var(--navy); display: block; margin-top: 4px; }

.decision-item { background: white; padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 11px; }
.decision-item strong { color: var(--brown); display: block; font-size: .8rem; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.decision-item p { margin: 0; font-size: .82rem; color: var(--muted); }

.resource-list { padding-left: 18px; font-size: .82rem; color: var(--muted); }
.resource-list li { margin-bottom: 5px; }

.form-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 15px; }
.field { margin-bottom: 14px; }
.field small { display: block; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 5px; font-size: .73rem; }
.result-box { padding: 18px; background: #EDF6EF; border: 1px solid #B5D8BF; border-radius: 12px; margin-top: 18px; }
.result-box h3 { color: #22543D; }
.result-box p { color: #2F4F3D; }

.empty-state {
  grid-column: 1 / -1;
  padding: 30px;
  text-align: center;
  background: white;
  border: 1px dashed var(--border);
  border-radius: 14px;
  color: var(--muted);
}
.hidden { display: none !important; }

footer { background: var(--navy); color: #D4DCE6; padding: 35px 22px; }
.footer-inner { max-width: 1280px; margin: auto; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
footer a { color: #F0D7BF; text-decoration: none; }
footer p { font-size: .8rem; }

.modal-backdrop {
  position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 100;
  background: rgba(5,14,28,.78); display: grid; place-items: center;
  padding: 18px;
}
.modal {
  background: var(--cream); border-radius: 18px; padding: 25px;
  max-width: 600px; width: 100%; max-height: 85vh; overflow-y: auto;
  box-shadow: 0 20px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
}
.modal h2 { color: var(--navy); }
.modal-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 15px; }
.modal-close { border: 0; background: transparent; color: var(--navy); font-size: 1.5rem; }

.pack-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
.pack-list li {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px;
  padding: 12px; background: white; border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: .82rem;
}
.pack-list button { border: 0; background: transparent; color: #9B2C2C; font-weight: 800; }

@media (max-width: 950px) {
  .nav-links { display: none; }
  .grid-4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); }
  .grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); }
  .model-steps { grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr); }
  .skill-options { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
}
@media (max-width: 620px) {
  .nav-wrap { padding: 10px 14px; }
  .brand-sub { display: none; }
  .nav-wrap > .header-actions .button { padding: 9px; font-size: .73rem; }
  .hero { padding: 45px 16px 35px; }
  main { padding: 30px 15px 50px; }
  .grid-2, .grid-3, .grid-4, .filters, .form-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .model-steps { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
  .skill-options { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .dark-panel { padding: 19px; }
  .search-row { flex-direction: column; }
  .hero h1 { letter-spacing: -1px; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header class="site-header">
  <div class="nav-wrap">
    <a href="#home" class="brand" style="text-decoration:none">
      <span class="brand-mark">⌖</span>
      <span>
        <span class="brand-name">PathKeeper</span>
        <span class="brand-sub">Strategic Intelligence & Opportunity Atlas</span>
      </span>
    </a>

    <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="#strategy">Strategy</a>
      <a href="#core-pathways">Core Pathways</a>
      <a href="#atlas">Opportunity Atlas</a>
      <a href="#coded">Coded Systems</a>
      <a href="#resources">Resources</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="header-actions" style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
      <button class="button button-outline button-small" onclick="openWizard()">Path Wizard</button>
      <button class="button button-primary button-small" onclick="openPack()">My Pack <span id="packCount">0</span></button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">The PathKeeper Framework Ecosystem</span>
    <h1>Turn Information Into a Path Forward.</h1>
    <p>
      Explore career pathways, strategic opportunities, technical systems,
      business ideas, and decision frameworks. Move from investigation to
      practical action with evidence, experiments, and measurable progress.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#strategy" class="button button-primary">Explore Strategic Intelligence</a>
      <a href="#atlas" class="button button-outline">Explore Opportunity Atlas</a>
      <button class="button button-brown" onclick="openWizard()">Find a Starting Path</button>
    </div>

    <div class="search-panel">
      <label for="globalSearch">Search the entire hub</label>
      <div class="search-row">
        <input id="globalSearch" type="search"
          placeholder="Try automation, career, business, evidence, leadership..."
          oninput="applyGlobalSearch()">
        <button class="button button-outline" onclick="clearSearch()">Clear search</button>
      </div>
      <div class="quick-filters">
        <span class="meta">QUICK SEARCH</span>
        <button onclick="quickSearch('career')">Career</button>
        <button onclick="quickSearch('technology')">Technology</button>
        <button onclick="quickSearch('business')">Business</button>
        <button onclick="quickSearch('automation')">Automation</button>
        <button onclick="quickSearch('evidence')">Proof of Work</button>
      </div>
      <p id="searchStatus" class="result-count" aria-live="polite">Showing all available content.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<main>

<!-- STRATEGIC INTELLIGENCE -->
<section class="section searchable-section" id="strategy">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <span class="section-kicker">Section 01 · Strategic Intelligence</span>
    <h2>Strategic Command Center</h2>
    <p>Investigate high-leverage opportunities, recognize patterns, challenge assumptions, and identify the next useful experiment.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="callout">
    <strong>Strategic signal:</strong>
    Focus on information that changes a decision. More information is not automatically better information.
  </div>

  <div class="filters">
    <div>
      <label for="strategyFocus">Choose an intelligence focus</label>
      <select id="strategyFocus" onchange="filterStrategy()">
        <option value="all">All strategic areas</option>
        <option value="technology">Technology</option>
        <option value="career">Career</option>
        <option value="innovation">Innovation</option>
        <option value="business">Business</option>
        <option value="personal">Personal strategy</option>
        <option value="decision">Decision intelligence</option>
      </select>
    </div>
    <div>
      <label for="strategyQuestion">Choose a strategic question</label>
      <select id="strategyQuestion" onchange="showStrategicQuestion()">
        <option value="">What should I investigate?</option>
        <option value="leverage">Where is leverage?</option>
        <option value="overlooked">What am I overlooking?</option>
        <option value="obsolete">What could become obsolete?</option>
        <option value="build">What can I build?</option>
        <option value="stop">What should I stop doing?</option>
      </select>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div id="questionResult" class="callout hidden" aria-live="polite"></div>

  <div class="grid grid-3" id="strategyGrid">
    <article class="card searchable-card" data-focus="technology" data-search="technology AI agent labor automation administrative workflows process scheduling reporting">
      <span class="card-tag">Technology leverage</span>
      <h3>AI-Agent Labor Force</h3>
      <p>Identify repetitive work that could be redesigned around automation instead of simply completed faster.</p>
      <details>
        <summary>Open strategic analysis</summary>
        <p><strong>Investigate:</strong> repeated tasks, predictable decisions, data movement, scheduling, reporting, and customer communication.</p>
        <p><strong>Test:</strong> document one workflow, automate one low-risk step, and compare time, quality, and error rates before and after.</p>
      </details>
      <button class="button button-outline button-small" onclick="addPack('AI-Agent Workflow Audit')">Add workflow audit to pack</button>
    </article>

    <article class="card searchable-card" data-focus="innovation" data-search="innovation cross industry synthesis logistics productivity subscription professional services">
      <span class="card-tag">Innovation</span>
      <h3>Cross-Industry Synthesis</h3>
      <p>Find new ideas by transferring useful principles from one industry to a different problem.</p>
      <details>
        <summary>Open strategic analysis</summary>
        <p>Choose an industry with an effective system. Ask how its underlying principle could solve a problem elsewhere.</p>
        <p><strong>Example:</strong> apply logistics optimization to learning plans, or subscription design to a professional service.</p>
      </details>
      <button class="button button-outline button-small" onclick="addPack('Cross-Industry Idea Canvas')">Add idea canvas to pack</button>
    </article>

    <article class="card searchable-card" data-focus="personal" data-search="personal strategy Phoenix framework changing direction sunk costs transferable skills fallback">
      <span class="card-tag">Personal strategy</span>
      <h3>The Phoenix Framework</h3>
      <p>Redesign a path when the current approach no longer produces useful results.</p>
      <details>
        <summary>Open strategic analysis</summary>
        <p>1. Identify what is not working. 2. Separate past investment from future value. 3. Identify transferable assets. 4. Test a new direction before fully committing.</p>
        <p><strong>Principle:</strong> preserve what is useful while changing what is ineffective.</p>
      </details>
      <button class="button button-outline button-small" onclick="addPack('Path Redesign Worksheet')">Add worksheet to pack</button>
    </article>

    <article class="card searchable-card" data-focus="business" data-search="business strategy micro SaaS acquisition recurring revenue customer retention operations automation">
      <span class="card-tag">Business strategy</span>
      <h3>Micro-SaaS Acquisition Thinking</h3>
      <p>Explore how existing small software businesses or systems might be improved, automated, or combined.</p>
      <details>
        <summary>Open strategic analysis</summary>
        <p>Investigate recurring revenue, customer retention, costs, owner dependence, customer acquisition, and operational weaknesses.</p>
        <p><strong>Before investing:</strong> validate financial records, legal ownership, liabilities, customer concentration, and the real workload.</p>
      </details>
      <button class="button button-outline button-small" onclick="addPack('Small Business Evaluation Checklist')">Add checklist to pack</button>
    </article>

    <article class="card searchable-card" data-focus="career" data-search="career skill evidence portfolio projects demonstrate ability learn practice build document">
      <span class="card-tag">Career intelligence</span>
      <h3>Skill-to-Evidence Strategy</h3>
      <p>Turn learning into visible proof that another person can inspect and evaluate.</p>
      <details>
        <summary>Open strategic analysis</summary>
        <p><strong>Build the chain:</strong> Learn → Practice → Build → Document → Demonstrate.</p>
        <p>Create projects, process improvements, analyses, case studies, code samples, or a portfolio. Record what you contributed and what the result shows.</p>
      </details>
      <button class="button button-outline button-small" onclick="addPack('Skill-to-Evidence Plan')">Add plan to pack</button>
    </article>

    <article class="card searchable-card" data-focus="decision" data-search="decision intelligence leverage point audit bottleneck root cause downstream outcomes">
      <span class="card-tag">Decision intelligence</span>
      <h3>The Leverage Point Audit</h3>
      <p>Find the small change that may improve several results at once.</p>
      <details>
        <summary>Open strategic analysis</summary>
        <p>Ask what repeatedly creates the problem, which decision controls the most consequences, and what bottleneck limits progress.</p>
        <p><strong>Next step:</strong> change one controllable factor and observe the result instead of assuming the cause.</p>
      </details>
      <button class="button button-outline button-small" onclick="addPack('Leverage Point Audit')">Add audit to pack</button>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CORE PATHWAYS -->
<section class="section searchable-section" id="core-pathways">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <span class="section-kicker">Section 02 · Core Pathways</span>
    <h2>The Core Opportunity Framework</h2>
    <p>A practical progression from discovering options to aligning a direction, executing useful work, and refining the result.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-4">
    <article class="card searchable-card" data-search="discovery strengths needs opportunities research capabilities">
      <span class="number">01</span><h3>Discovery</h3>
      <p>Identify your interests, existing capabilities, unmet needs, constraints, and possible directions before committing resources.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card searchable-card" data-search="alignment career goals strengths resources institutions priorities">
      <span class="number">02</span><h3>Alignment</h3>
      <p>Connect personal strengths and goals with real opportunities, available resources, market needs, and strategic partnerships.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="card searchable-card" data-search="execution projects workflow action measurable output">
      <span class="number">03</span><h3>Execution</h3>
